[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16985.91, "timestamp": "04:43:05", "text": "広告休憩は終了しました。うん。ついに。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16992.708, "timestamp": "04:43:12", "text": "正直に言うと、私には一つしかありません"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16995.75, "timestamp": "04:43:15", "text": "残り1ヶ月。それは私が行く前の3月です"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16998.628, "timestamp": "04:43:18", "text": "日本。だから、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17001.75, "timestamp": "04:43:21", "text": "監視システムと自動化システム"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17003.51, "timestamp": "04:43:23", "text": "どこ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17006.39, "timestamp": "04:43:26", "text": "ええと、私が家にいないとき、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17009.03, "timestamp": "04:43:29", "text": "家族にただ向きを変えて"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17013.03, "timestamp": "04:43:33", "text": "私のPCで何かしたら"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17014.628, "timestamp": "04:43:34", "text": "どうにか"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17018.23, "timestamp": "04:43:38", "text": "ええと、ウェイクオンは可能だと思います"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17024.47, "timestamp": "04:43:44", "text": "公に、ある種の"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17029.51, "timestamp": "04:43:49", "text": "ローカル サーバー ローカル ネットワーク。だからもし私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17031.67, "timestamp": "04:43:51", "text": "別の国に移動するには、クリックするだけで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17035.99, "timestamp": "04:43:55", "text": "魔法の電話を送るボタン"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17038.23, "timestamp": "04:43:58", "text": "とか。 PCの電源をオンにできる"}]